===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{senseid|en|Q44367}} {{lb|en|baseball}} A moderate rotation speed backspin [[pitch]] thrown with a ball gripped between the index finger and middle finger; it has good velocity, may have a precessing spin, and sinks as it approaches the [[plate]].
#: {{ux|en|His strikeout pitch was his '''split-finger fastball'''.}}

